buf.append(" world");","key_points":["String is immutable, guaranteeing thread safety but inefficient for modifications","StringBuilder is mutable and not synchronized, ideal for single‑threaded string building","StringBuffer is mutable and synchronized, safe for concurrent use but slower"]}

